(5106910, 744294, 98022, '<td valign="top">great contrasting colors &amp; textures.</td>', 'great contrasting colors & textures.', '2008-12-04 20:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5106977, 742415, 76598, '<td valign="top">Use all your pixels, it is hard to judge being so small, but it looks out of focus.</td>', 'Use all your pixels, it is hard to judge being so small, but it looks out of focus.', '2008-12-04 20:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107113, 743073, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice clean lines here.  I like the symatry you have going here.  I like that the middle mast is black, the other two are purple.  There is a hint of pink in the clouds, which could maybe have been brought out a little more.</td>', 'Nice clean lines here.  I like the symatry you have going here.  I like that the middle mast is black, the other two are purple.  There is a hint of pink in the clouds, which could maybe have been brought out a little more.', '2008-12-04 21:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107118, 743937, 96881, '<td valign="top">The fact that the straight lines are not really noticable does not help.  The very shallow depth of field means that much of the photo is OOF, and I had to look to find the bit that is in focus.  As that part is nothing special, I don''t think it works here</td>', 'The fact that the straight lines are not really noticable does not help.  The very shallow depth of field means that much of the photo is OOF, and I had to look to find the bit that is in focus.  As that part is nothing special, I don''t think it works here', '2008-12-04 21:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107122, 744304, 96881, '<td valign="top">The simplicity of many phoitos here works, however I am not sure you have acheieved it here.  The keyboard location I think needed to be lower and further right, more towards the corner to really make the statement here</td>', 'The simplicity of many phoitos here works, however I am not sure you have acheieved it here.  The keyboard location I think needed to be lower and further right, more towards the corner to really make the statement here', '2008-12-04 21:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107126, 744140, 96881, '<td valign="top">Its a joint.   The lines behind from the sleepers though help this photo, as they run the opposite direction.  Shallow DOF does work here, as does the B&amp;W and the border</td>', 'Its a joint.   The lines behind from the sleepers though help this photo, as they run the opposite direction.  Shallow DOF does work here, as does the B&W and the border', '2008-12-04 21:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107131, 744159, 96881, '<td valign="top">OK, I have no idea at the moment what this is.  With the Straight lines (Take a photo that includes only straight lines) I am also trying to see the real relevance of the shot.  A very shallow DOF means only a brief strip is in focus.......Not really getting the intent here.</td>', 'OK, I have no idea at the moment what this is.  With the Straight lines (Take a photo that includes only straight lines) I am also trying to see the real relevance of the shot.  A very shallow DOF means only a brief strip is in focus.......Not really getting the intent here.', '2008-12-04 21:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107134, 744253, 96881, '<td valign="top">The rail is overexposed.  Normally not a big problem with this type of shot, except that there are areas which are not, due to the wear and marks ont he rails, and I am not sure what further up.  The fact that this means the rail does not have great striaght lines either side does affect the effect you are trying to acheive here.  The rest of the photo is good.  I would have had a little more angle, and therefore not had any background area at all.</td>', 'The rail is overexposed.  Normally not a big problem with this type of shot, except that there are areas which are not, due to the wear and marks ont he rails, and I am not sure what further up.  The fact that this means the rail does not have great striaght lines either side does affect the effect you are trying to acheive here.  The rest of the photo is good.  I would have had a little more angle, and therefore not had any background area at all.', '2008-12-04 21:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107136, 744246, 96881, '<td valign="top">The reflections off the glass are distracting, and take away from the effect you are after.  Cropping out the stairs etc in the bottom also would have been better, as they add nothing to the overall effect</td>', 'The reflections off the glass are distracting, and take away from the effect you are after.  Cropping out the stairs etc in the bottom also would have been better, as they add nothing to the overall effect', '2008-12-04 21:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107145, 744179, 96881, '<td valign="top">Simple, elegant, sharp, composed of only straight lines, while not being boring.  This is what this challenge should be all about.  We have colour, contrast, shaddows, highlights, dark patches.......Everything.......<br/>Great Submission.  Best I have see so far......Well Done</td>', 'Simple, elegant, sharp, composed of only straight lines, while not being boring.  This is what this challenge should be all about.  We have colour, contrast, shaddows, highlights, dark patches.......Everything.......Great Submission.  Best I have see so far......Well Done', '2008-12-04 21:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107149, 744161, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice Idea, however the cropping of the pipes at the ends, while it may have been unavoidable, reduces the effect.  Having these in the photo, and the crop running straight int he dark patch beside them would be better, however maybe not possible.<br/> <br/>And the curves on the pipes are going to hurt you, with the challenge description saying "only straight lines"</td>', 'Nice Idea, however the cropping of the pipes at the ends, while it may have been unavoidable, reduces the effect.  Having these in the photo, and the crop running straight int he dark patch beside them would be better, however maybe not possible. And the curves on the pipes are going to hurt you, with the challenge description saying "only straight lines"', '2008-12-04 21:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107157, 744107, 96881, '<td valign="top">Details: Capture an image that includes only straight lines.<br/> <br/>Nice idea, but the challenge details were pretty clear on only straight lines<br/> <br/>The large light thing in the background (a head???) is clutter that is a distraction and not needed.  having a plainish brown background caused by the shallow DOF would have been better.</td>', 'Details: Capture an image that includes only straight lines. Nice idea, but the challenge details were pretty clear on only straight lines The large light thing in the background (a head???) is clutter that is a distraction and not needed.  having a plainish brown background caused by the shallow DOF would have been better.', '2008-12-04 21:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107163, 743245, 96881, '<td valign="top">Details: Capture an image that includes only straight lines.<br/> <br/>Nice idea, but the challenge details were pretty clear on only straight lines<br/> <br/>Thsi photo doesn''t jump out at me.  I think a lack of contrasting elements means it all merges too much into each other here</td>', 'Details: Capture an image that includes only straight lines. Nice idea, but the challenge details were pretty clear on only straight lines Thsi photo doesn''t jump out at me.  I think a lack of contrasting elements means it all merges too much into each other here', '2008-12-04 21:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107193, 743796, 37719, '<td valign="top">A little on the soft side - perhaps slightly out of focus.  Piano keys are ''hard'' objects with  very clear lines and form.  I would think a ''harder'' focus would do them more justice.  A slight WB adjustment appears to be needed as well.<br/> <br/>On a personal side: the name should clue one in - OCTAVE - meaning eight (8) - C to C, not C to B.  I think, for some reason, this disturbs me more than the softness.</td>', 'A little on the soft side - perhaps slightly out of focus.  Piano keys are ''hard'' objects with  very clear lines and form.  I would think a ''harder'' focus would do them more justice.  A slight WB adjustment appears to be needed as well. On a personal side: the name should clue one in - OCTAVE - meaning eight (8) - C to C, not C to B.  I think, for some reason, this disturbs me more than the softness.', '2008-12-04 21:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107430, 744362, 96881, '<td valign="top">Different.  Looking forward to seeing the description.  I assume this is metal you heated and then put on a black backdrop/<br/> <br/>I think the colours you go tout of this are good, the angle and crop are good s well</td>', 'Different.  Looking forward to seeing the description.  I assume this is metal you heated and then put on a black backdrop/ I think the colours you go tout of this are good, the angle and crop are good s well', '2008-12-04 23:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107444, 744244, 96881, '<td valign="top">What is the blue light stretching to the clouds.  Hey, it is straight!!!<br/> <br/>Like the colours, the white line, the clouds all work well.  great capture</td>', 'What is the blue light stretching to the clouds.  Hey, it is straight!!! Like the colours, the white line, the clouds all work well.  great capture', '2008-12-04 23:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107461, 743470, 96881, '<td valign="top">This statue might be really interesting in real life, but I don''t think it photographs well.  All of the lines and pieces turn into a distraction.<br/> <br/>Don''t know who it is, but hey, I''m Australian........<br/> <br/>The lighting is very direct, and therefore causes refelctions from weird places that also doesn''t work</td>', 'This statue might be really interesting in real life, but I don''t think it photographs well.  All of the lines and pieces turn into a distraction. Don''t know who it is, but hey, I''m Australian........ The lighting is very direct, and therefore causes refelctions from weird places that also doesn''t work', '2008-12-04 23:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107478, 742329, 96881, '<td valign="top">"take a Photo that contains only straight lines"<br/> <br/>Yes, its a straight row of chairs, however, the details were specific that ONLY straight lines should be visible.  There are curves everywhere through this. Sorry, but that was the challenge.<br/> <br/>The depth of field is good.  I might have taken from higher, giving more of the red/black sequence, and removuing the red thing at the back.</td>', '"take a Photo that contains only straight lines" Yes, its a straight row of chairs, however, the details were specific that ONLY straight lines should be visible.  There are curves everywhere through this. Sorry, but that was the challenge. The depth of field is good.  I might have taken from higher, giving more of the red/black sequence, and removuing the red thing at the back.', '2008-12-04 23:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5107485, 744291, 96881, '<td valign="top">Good use of only straight lines to create an interesting photo.  Lacks a real subject to get the maximum votes, as it is just a landing.  Difficult lighting conditions as had you tried to not overexpose the upper areas, the lower left parts would have been very dark.  Good effort</td>', 'Good use of only straight lines to create an interesting photo.  Lacks a real subject to get the maximum votes, as it is just a landing.  Difficult lighting conditions as had you tried to not overexpose the upper areas, the lower left parts would have been very dark.  Good effort', '2008-12-04 23:48:50.000000', NULL, 1);
