(5120541, 743876, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m not totally sure about this shot. It has a lot of potential, but I think the focal point where my eye is led is too high. Perhaps a bit of a color cast to it as well, from fluorescent lighting.<br/> <br/>I got curious and popped it into my photo editor.  Some levels, curves, WB, and contrast really brought out some nice detail in the stairs and chrome rails, giving this some pleasing dimension and pop.</td>', 'I''m not totally sure about this shot. It has a lot of potential, but I think the focal point where my eye is led is too high. Perhaps a bit of a color cast to it as well, from fluorescent lighting. I got curious and popped it into my photo editor.  Some levels, curves, WB, and contrast really brought out some nice detail in the stairs and chrome rails, giving this some pleasing dimension and pop.', '2008-12-09 20:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
