(5121308, 742528, 96751, '<td valign="top">I''m with Jac on the simplicity of this shot.  The "less is more" aspect of photography is incredibly satisfying.  And I also agree with LuDeLush - the white border might be to dissipating.  Regardless...  Congrats on this really lovely shot.</td>', 'I''m with Jac on the simplicity of this shot.  The "less is more" aspect of photography is incredibly satisfying.  And I also agree with LuDeLush - the white border might be to dissipating.  Regardless...  Congrats on this really lovely shot.', '2008-12-10 01:50:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5121314, 744367, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great job.  Please tell us what it is.  I say a power tower.</td>', 'Great job.  Please tell us what it is.  I say a power tower.', '2008-12-10 01:52:13.000000', NULL, 0),
