(5127457, 744321, 30214, '<td valign="top">Almost Van Gogh :). Nice photo, I guess small image size hurt you here. In these basic challenges you really need to build your composition from some large blocks, otherwise it does not look sharp enough. I think the same thing happened to my shot in this challenge :).</td>', 'Almost Van Gogh :). Nice photo, I guess small image size hurt you here. In these basic challenges you really need to build your composition from some large blocks, otherwise it does not look sharp enough. I think the same thing happened to my shot in this challenge :).', '2008-12-12 16:07:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5127524, 744321, 43156, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LevT:</b></div><hr/><i> Almost Van Gogh :). Nice photo, I guess small image size hurt you here. In these basic challenges you really need to build your composition from some large blocks, otherwise it does not look sharp enough. I think the same thing happened to my shot in this challenge :). </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hey, you are absolutely right about small image. I had to cut about 2/3 of the whole image to make it fit into this challenge:)</td>', 'Originally posted by LevT: Almost Van Gogh :). Nice photo, I guess small image size hurt you here. In these basic challenges you really need to build your composition from some large blocks, otherwise it does not look sharp enough. I think the same thing happened to my shot in this challenge :).   Hey, you are absolutely right about small image. I had to cut about 2/3 of the whole image to make it fit into this challenge:)', '2008-12-12 16:49:24.000000', NULL, 0),
