(5142118, 743642, 24454, '<td valign="top">I agree.  I think a 4.85 is a little harsh for this.  I think the golden light and the foggy detail in the autumn bushes makes it pretty interesting.<br/> <br/>My first photography teacher used to always harp on our photos saying, "There''s no real subject".   I think maybe that may be why it was votes so harshly, there isn''t a clear "something" that says, "Look at this.  This is it!"    <br/> <br/></td>', 'I agree.  I think a 4.85 is a little harsh for this.  I think the golden light and the foggy detail in the autumn bushes makes it pretty interesting. My first photography teacher used to always harp on our photos saying, "There''s no real subject".   I think maybe that may be why it was votes so harshly, there isn''t a clear "something" that says, "Look at this.  This is it!"     ', '2008-12-20 00:50:49.000000', NULL, 0),
