(6075866, 744408, 14476, '<td valign="top">LOL - 5.70 isn''t bad for a score!  <br/> <br/>This is a fun image and gave me a big smile when I saw it.  <br/> <br/>Back in August ''07, <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=16197" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">LittleGett</a> ran a side challenge that featured a participant''s willingness to take on one fork for an entire month.  30 pics of forks was a daunting challenge and gave me new respect for this useful instrument.<br/> <br/>You''ve done a fine job here.</td>', 'LOL - 5.70 isn''t bad for a score!   This is a fun image and gave me a big smile when I saw it.   Back in August ''07,  LittleGett ran a side challenge that featured a participant''s willingness to take on one fork for an entire month.  30 pics of forks was a daunting challenge and gave me new respect for this useful instrument. You''ve done a fine job here.', '2010-07-01 13:09:14.000000', NULL, 0),
